{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/,_N_T_/index"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/__PAGE__","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" class=\"geist_a71539c9-module__T19VSG__variable geist_mono_8d43a2aa-module__8Li5zG__variable h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.0r6juujl39pe6.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.0wgildi0cnwt9.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3bv806-f7lww0.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/10qk6v6416kh8.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0paxexg6-m0de.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/25o46h8mdjlrg.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/01-klzdl5npc5.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-1cxx7vire7976.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/38u96dphxy9bt.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1ikh770loukco.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Create Next App</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Generated by create next app\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"min-h-dvh bg-[#08090b] text-neutral-300\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-8 py-20\"><p class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] text-neutral-600\">BACKLUND · 1984</p><h1 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-5xl tracking-[0.12em] text-neutral-100\">NOIR CITY</h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-xl font-serif text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-400\">You are a private investigator with two rooms above a tobacconist on Iron Cross Street. The police are bought, the courts are slow, and the only clock that matters is the one running down while you decide where to go next.</p><ul class=\"mt-14 space-y-4\"><li class=\"border border-neutral-800 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl text-neutral-100\">The Quiet Room</h2><span class=\"shrink-0 border border-amber-200/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-[9px] tracking-[0.2em] text-amber-200/70\">START HERE</span></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-600\">3<!-- --> SUSPECTS · <!-- -->5<!-- --> ADDRESSES · <!-- -->32<!-- --> HOURS</p><p class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-400\">Six people sat in the dark at 85 Sodela Walk on Thursday evening to speak with the dead. When the lamp came back up, Ottoline Frayne was still in her chair with her eyes open and her heart stopped. The doctor at the table signed her off as heart failure inside the hour, which is very quick work, and her solicitor would like a second opinion. Four addresses. Three days. Everything you need is inside them, and one of the six people at that table is lying to you about something that has nothing to do with the murder.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3\"><a class=\"text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-amber-100\" href=\"/play/the-quiet-room\">PLAY ALONE →</a><span title=\"Set NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL and friends to enable rooms\" class=\"cursor-not-allowed text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-800\">WITH FRIENDS — NOT CONFIGURED</span></div></li><li class=\"border border-neutral-800 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl text-neutral-100\">Harbor Lights</h2></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-600\">5<!-- --> SUSPECTS · <!-- -->14<!-- --> ADDRESSES · <!-- -->48<!-- --> HOURS</p><p class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-400\">They pulled Tommy Vance out of No. 4 Dry Dock on Tuesday morning, and the dock has been drained since the middle of last month. The police wrote it up as a fall and closed it in a day. His sister does not believe them, and she has scraped together forty pounds to say so. You have until Friday.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3\"><a class=\"text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-amber-100\" href=\"/play/harbor-lights\">PLAY ALONE →</a><span title=\"Set NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL and friends to enable rooms\" class=\"cursor-not-allowed text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-800\">WITH FRIENDS — NOT CONFIGURED</span></div></li><li class=\"border border-neutral-800 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl text-neutral-100\">The Bell Does Not Lie</h2></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-600\">5<!-- --> SUSPECTS · <!-- -->12<!-- --> ADDRESSES · <!-- -->44<!-- --> HOURS</p><p class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-400\">Alderman Cornelius Reeve went into the library at the Delgado Assembly Rooms during a subscription dinner and did not come out. Nine people were in the building and every one of them can tell you exactly where they stood when the Bell of Order struck nine, because that is the sort of evening it was. All nine accounts agree. That is the first thing about this case that ought to worry you.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3\"><a class=\"text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-400 transition hover:text-amber-100\" href=\"/play/the-bell-does-not-lie\">PLAY ALONE →</a><span title=\"Set NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL and friends to enable rooms\" class=\"cursor-not-allowed text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-800\">WITH FRIENDS — NOT CONFIGURED</span></div></li></ul><p class=\"mt-16 text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-700\"><a class=\"transition hover:text-neutral-400\" href=\"/map\">OR WALK THE CITY WITHOUT A CASE →</a></p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/10qk6v6416kh8.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/38u96dphxy9bt.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1ikh770loukco.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3bv806-f7lww0.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.0r6juujl39pe6.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.0wgildi0cnwt9.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",16],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\